Z||000001||Songman||03-09-2001||10:43 PM||||There are several Monte Carlo resources. Not anything like this that I know of though...<P>I have a list of links somewhere and I will post them when I can find them.<P>I have a 1987 Monte Carlo SS Aerocoupe tha I am building. Probably the best site is by a guy named Paul. Can't remember right off. He has an Aerocoupe registry there. You might search for that...<P>Good luck with your car. If I can help, I will be glad to..<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
