Z||000003||Songman||03-09-2001||10:46 PM||||And yes, you can build sort of an SS clone from an SS. Remove all the chrome, add the SS front and rear, fender extensions, rear spoiler, etc... The interior is a bigger challenge if he wants to change it... Have him e-mail me with questions if he needs to.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
